      "function": "Indicates suction or discharge pressure for operation and performance checks.",
      "construction": "Bourdon-tube gauge with isolation valve; glycerine filled for pulsating service.",
      "material": "Stainless steel case and wetted parts.",
      "operating_conditions": "Range so that normal reading is mid-scale.",
      "failure_modes": [
        "Pulsation damage",
        "Blocked impulse line"
      ],
      "inspection": [
