      "construction": "Machined back plate/stuffing-box cover bolted between casing and bearing frame; may have back wear ring or pump-out vanes.",
      "material": "As casing.",
      "operating_conditions": "Seal chamber pressure depends on balance holes and back clearance.",
      "failure_modes": [
